  "releaseNotes": "Major release matching Amazon S3 wire behavior, verified against Amazon S3: operation-scoped parameter validation with exact S3 errors; encoding-type=url listings; exact ListObjects v1/v2 shapes; DeleteObjects quiet mode; HEAD Range support and S3 range rules; S3 error detail elements; millisecond timestamps; CORS and Accept-Charset headers off by default (EmitCorsHeaders). Adds a compatibility test suite. See CHANGELOG.md for breaking changes and migration notes.",
